WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-14T01:42:43Z","updated_at":"2025-01-16T19:56:25Z","body":"I don't know why it's not accepting `Control::TextDirection`, maybe because i'm extending the class from Container.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2588583328/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2588852141","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101487#issuecomment-2588852141","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101487","id":2588852141,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aTr-t","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-14T03:37:57Z","updated_at":"2025-01-14T03:37:57Z","body":"The property `FoldableContainer::text_direction` conflicts with the enum `Container::TextDirection` because in C# property names are converted to PascalCase. It seems we already have similar cases for other Control nodes, and we just suppress the warning. See:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/b3a44e8d5195d184dd32e7a03db9946244853ec8/modules/mono/editor/bindings_generator.cpp#L135-L143","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2588852141/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2589360799","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101487#issuecomment-2589360799","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101487","id":2589360799,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aVoKf","user":{"login":"ckaiser","id":138269,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODI2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138269?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ckaiser","html_url":"https://github.com/ckaiser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ckaiser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ckaiser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ckaiser/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ckaiser/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ckaiser/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ckaiser/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ckaiser/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ckaiser/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ckaiser/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-14T08:59:08Z","updated_at":"2025-01-14T08:59:08Z","body":"Did some testing, I'm liking the direction it's going, some thoughts and notes as I was trying it out:\r\n\r\nThere's no simple way to adjust the sizing of the buttons, which means you have to control that with the icon, which could be cumbersome, IMO. A theme override for `icon_max_width` like `Button` has would suffice.\r\n\r\n\"Toggle On\" is inconsistent with how `BaseButton` refers to toggle buttons: \"Button Pressed\"\r\n\r\nAPI wise, the fact that `expanded` is the property you set/get and `folding_changed(is_folded)` is the signal seems inconsistent.\r\nThere's also the problem that the Node type already contains references to folding, so I can totally see a user trying to use `node.is_displayed_folded()` with autocomplete or something like that.\r\nIt might be better to just use `expanded` in all cases, problem with that is that it leaves the name of the node as the only use of the word \"fold\". I usually see these kinds of widgets also be referred to as \"accordion\" widgets (and indeed, having functionality to link multiple of these together like `ButtonGroup` would be nice eventually).\r\n\r\nFound a weird bug when testing it in an EditorPlugin, when inside the bottom panel the contents of the foldable container expand to include the title, see here:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8008f963-5f0e-4f6f-9c99-0a651c236bf3)\r\n\r\nIf I fold the container and then expand it, it behaves normally afterwards, and running the scene makes it behave normally, so it's got to be a weird quirk of either the editor theme or the plugin initialization, I'm attaching an MRP so you can test it: [foldable-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18407936/foldable-mrp.zip).\r\n\r\nHaven't looked at the code or documentation, but good work so far! This will be very useful for editor UI, plugins, configuration, etc.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2589360799/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2591636063","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101487#issuecomment-2591636063","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101487","id":2591636063,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aeTpf","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-15T04:39:58Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T04:53:44Z","body":"Updated the code and added `FoldableGroup` resource which will allow expanding only one container at a time.\r\nAdded `fold()` and `expand()` helpers that will emit `folding_changed`\r\nAdded `set_expanded` and `is_expanded` as helpers for readability because `!folded` is a bit confusing, we also have `set_folded` and `is_folded` as the main setter/getter.\r\n\r\nThanks for all the suggestions.\r\n\r\n[Screencast from 01-15-2025 06:32:20 AM.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/44dd79c9-ff55-4367-bdf6-d61958317d33)\r\n\r\nAlso updated the testing project [foldable-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18419085/foldable-test.zip).\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2591636063/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2591656144","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101487#issuecomment-2591656144","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101487","id":2591656144,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aeYjQ","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-15T05:00:53Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T05:01:17Z","body":"> There's no simple way to adjust the sizing of the buttons, which means you have to control that with the icon, which could be cumbersome, IMO. A theme override for `icon_max_width` like `Button` has would suffice.\r\n\r\nI don't know how this should work, maybe we can note that all icons must have the same size.\r\n\r\n> \"Toggle On\" is inconsistent with how `BaseButton` refers to toggle buttons: \"Button Pressed\"\r\n\r\nButtons groups will be tricky to implement, currently it can be managed from code when the pressed/toggled signal emits.\r\n\r\n>I usually see these kinds of widgets also be referred to as \"accordion\" widgets (and indeed, having functionality to link multiple of these together like `ButtonGroup` would be nice eventually).\r\n\r\nAdded `FoldableGroup` resource.\r\n\r\n> Found a weird bug when testing it in an EditorPlugin, when inside the bottom panel the contents of the foldable container expand to include the title\r\n\r\nFixed and updated the test project to include more examples.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2591656144/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2591700648","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101487#issuecomment-2591700648","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101487","id":2591700648,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aejao","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-15T05:46:10Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T05:46:10Z","body":"I also want to allow popups support for buttons, I can add `button_get_popup_position`, which returns the correct screen position for the popup and will not store the popups for each button, users will be able to show/hide them freely when `button_pressed` or `button_toggled` emits. Because buttons are not nodes and can't easily get the screen position or transform for them.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2591700648/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2592783100","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101487#issuecomment-2592783100","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101487","id":2592783100,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6airr8","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https: